1
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:54,960
We're rich!

2
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,759
We made a fortune!

3
00:00:59,079 --> 00:00:59,880
Li Wen.

4
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:02,560
Good job.

5
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:05,719
Now we just sit back and count the cash.

6
00:01:09,079 --> 00:01:10,799
Come on, come on.

7
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,200
So what if they're the cops?

8
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:15,840
They're still nothing but...

9
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,359
...losers to us.

10
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:18,560
Yeah.

11
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,239
Just a joke to go with our drinks.

12
00:01:20,599 --> 00:01:21,760
Cheers!

13
00:01:24,079 --> 00:01:24,879
Drink up.

14
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:28,640
Thanks, Bro Snake.

15
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:47,920
Hello?

16
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,480
Did you get the money?

17
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,239
We have a problem.

18
00:01:50,239 --> 00:01:51,920
We can't withdraw any of the money.

19
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:53,000
What?

20
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,560
Bro Snake.

21
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,079
They called back.

22
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,599
What the hell are you doing?

23
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:13,960
Listen to me, Grass Snake.

24
00:02:15,199 --> 00:02:16,479
I took down your hideout

25
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,879
and arrested a lot of your men.

26
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:20,199
We've already locked onto your funding channels.

27
00:02:20,199 --> 00:02:21,080
This money

28
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,800
will be transferred back soon.

29
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,159
Just wait for me to come arrest you.

30
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:27,599
Sun Ming, right?

31
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:29,199
You and I are sworn enemies.

32
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,639
Don't worry.

33
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:40,159
This money,

34
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,199
we'll get it back for you very soon.

35
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,919
Thank you.

36
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,719
Thank you, officers.

37
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,560
If this money were gone,

38
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:51,759
I really wouldn't know how to face my daughter.

39
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,240
Bro Liu.

40
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,280
Bro Snake.

41
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,120
What's wrong?

42
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:07,479
Go find me a big target right now.

43
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:10,159
I must get revenge.

44
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:30,960
Thanks to you delaying the withdrawal,

45
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,560
Huang Shanshan's parents got it back.

46
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,360
This is way too dangerous.

47
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,560
What if my daughter gets dragged in?

48
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,879
Huang Shanshan is someone's daughter too.

49
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:05,960
Old Gu.

50
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,280
Regardless,

51
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,159
thank you for this.

52
00:04:10,199 --> 00:04:11,000
I mean it.

53
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,879
If we let Grass Snake succeed this time,

54
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:17,560
Huang Shanshan's parents might be at risk.

55
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,360
Are you going to keep helping Grass Snake

56
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,959
do these utterly immoral things?

57
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:25,680
My life is none of your business.

58
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,879
Then what about Gu Ting?

59
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,000
Just stop.

60
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:36,480
That kid is completely obsessed with you.

61
00:04:39,439 --> 00:04:40,240
Promise me.

62
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,240
Make the call.

63
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:45,720
The number is...

64
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,279
I know the number.

65
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,720
I've memorized it.

66
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,480
Hello?

67
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:10,319
It's Li Wen.

68
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:12,319
Li Wen, where have you been lately?

69
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:13,040
When are you coming back?

70
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,279
I miss you.

71
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:21,160
Well, I mean...

72
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,160
Have you finished writing your novel?

73
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,439
I really want to read it.

74
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:29,240
Gu Ting.

75
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:32,879
I'm sorry.

76
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,720
What's wrong?

77
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,560
Why apologize all of a sudden?

78
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,120
I'm not a writer.

79
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,639
I only got close to you to use you.

80
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,680
To get in touch with your dad.

81
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:49,639
He could help me achieve my goal.

82
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:52,120
Did my dad bother you again?

83
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:52,759
Don't worry.

84
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:53,720
I'll go tell him off right now.

85
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,000
It has nothing to do with your dad.

86
00:05:57,959 --> 00:05:59,199
My work here is done.

87
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:01,519
It's time to leave.

88
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,680
You're kidding, right?

89
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,560
I'm not kidding.

90
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,079
I don't want to hurt you anymore.

91
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,439
From now on,

92
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,160
I won't see you again,

93
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:22,000
and I won't contact you.

94
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,439
I'm sorry.

95
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,199
Li Wen.

96
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:50,000
The number you dialed is unavailable.

97
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,680
To leave a message, please press one.

98
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,160
All right.

99
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:14,839
I should probably head back.

100
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:17,120
Working for Grass Snake,

101
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,240
I'm bound to get in trouble eventually.

102
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,680
I'll say one more thing.

103
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,199
Get out of the game while you can.

104
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,160
Once Gu Ting finds out, it'll be too late.

105
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,720
What if they threaten me with Tingting?

106
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,759
What am I supposed to do?

107
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,000
I need to be more careful.

108
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,959
I can't let Gu Ting get involved again.

109
00:08:01,879 --> 00:08:02,800
Grass Snake,

110
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:04,000
you've got some nerve.

111
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:05,879
I told you

112
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:07,639
to keep a low profile.

113
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:09,120
Do you not understand?

114
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,160
No, sir.

115
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,160
I...

116
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,639
I was just so furious.

117
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,879
That's why I...

118
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:17,879
The police are monitoring those girls now.

119
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:20,439
Yet you defy the crackdown at such a time?

120
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,199
Are you insane?

121
00:08:21,199 --> 00:08:22,319
Sir,

122
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,920
I know I was wrong.

123
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,040
Please give me another chance.

124
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:28,720
Take a few days off.

125
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,800
As for the company,

126
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,920
let Bro Liu take over for now.

127
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,720
No, sir, I...

128
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,440
You got a problem with that?

129
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,360
No, no.

130
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,720
That's how it's going to be.

131
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:55,519
Come in.

132
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,000
Teacher.

133
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,080
Am I interrupting?

134
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:02,759
Not at all.

135
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:16,840
What's wrong?

136
00:09:17,759 --> 00:09:19,039
By the look on your face,

137
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,720
you fought with your dad again.

138
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:23,320
He's been acting secretive lately.

139
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,720
He's nowhere to be found,

140
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,840
and I can't reach him by phone.

141
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:29,159
I'm starting to suspect he's in debt.

142
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:30,240
If that's the case,

143
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,360
you need to move out.

144
00:09:31,799 --> 00:09:32,840
It'll be safer that way.

145
00:09:33,399 --> 00:09:34,519
As for an apartment,

146
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:36,080
I can help you find one.

147
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,879
I've already moved out.

148
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,559
You've already moved out?

149
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,440
Then where are you living now?

150
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:44,759
I'm staying at a friend's place.

151
00:09:46,559 --> 00:09:47,879
A boyfriend's place?

152
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:50,039
No, just a regular friend.

153
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,120
Gu Ting.

154
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:01,840
You know, you

155
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,240
can rely on me.

156
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,360
You know what I mean.

157
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:16,679
Teacher.

158
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,919
I don't quite understand what you mean.

159
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:21,679
I have something to do. I'll get going.

160
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,519
You'll agree sooner or later.

161
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:52,279
So that's why Teacher was nice to me.

162
00:10:55,159 --> 00:10:57,240
I can't find my dad either.

163
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,759
And Li Wen has disappeared too.

164
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:05,840
Now I can't even stay at school.

165
00:11:12,679 --> 00:11:14,559
Where on earth are you guys?

166
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,879
Leather seats.

167
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:23,679
It really is different.

168
00:11:24,759 --> 00:11:25,559
Little Snake,

169
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,759
brew a pot of Pu'er.

170
00:11:28,559 --> 00:11:30,360
The 20-year-old cake.

171
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:34,919
Brother Liu.

172
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:37,879
Bro Snake!

173
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:41,480
I noticed this chair was a bit wobbly.

174
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:43,000
I was just testing it out for you.

175
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:44,559
Come, come.

176
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:45,600
Have a seat, Bro Snake.

177
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,320
You were really getting into it, huh.

178
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,480
Bro Snake,

179
00:11:54,519 --> 00:11:56,600
I'm here to show you this.

180
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,120
Take a look.

181
00:12:01,919 --> 00:12:03,960
This charity nursing home

182
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:05,759
recently received a donation.

183
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:07,120
A few million in total.

184
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,919
Their director is an old man.

185
00:12:09,159 --> 00:12:10,799
He's planning to expand the nursing home.

186
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,120
I think

187
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:14,679
we can propose a joint development project

188
00:12:14,679 --> 00:12:15,480
to scam him out of his money.

189
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:18,440
These old geezers,

190
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,000
what do they need all that money for?

191
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,080
Yeah.

192
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,879
Might as well leave it to me.

193
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,080
But Bro Snake,

194
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:26,960
this old man

195
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,919
is quite cautious.

196
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:30,759
I doubt ordinary methods will trick him.

197
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,360
Then we'll prepare a big gift for him.

198
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,120
Great.

199
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,720
Brother Liu,

200
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,759
should I tell the others

201
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,000
to put someone else in charge?

202
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,279
Bro Snake.

203
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:47,919
Bro Snake always calls the shots here.

204
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:49,080
If anyone disagrees,

205
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,720
I, Bro Liu, will chop him up first.

206
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:52,919
Sensible.

207
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:02,759
Li Wen.

208
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,360
I've got a job for you.

209
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:06,559
Build a construction company website.

210
00:13:07,039 --> 00:13:09,320
Make it look like a Fortune 500 company.

211
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:12,840
Also, set up a virtual trading platform.

212
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,240
Make it quick.

213
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:15,759
A construction company?

214
00:13:16,759 --> 00:13:18,559
Alright. Any other requirements?

215
00:13:18,759 --> 00:13:20,480
I'm the boss of the construction company.

216
00:13:20,679 --> 00:13:22,120
Make up a fake identity for me too.

217
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,320
The important thing is

218
00:13:23,679 --> 00:13:25,200
the identity of a philanthropist.

219
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:27,320
Bro Snake,

220
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:29,360
we've got a new gig already?

221
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:31,879
Just do as you're told.

222
00:13:31,879 --> 00:13:33,159
Stop asking questions.

223
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:34,000
Bro Snake,

224
00:13:34,399 --> 00:13:36,399
I really didn't blow that last gig.

225
00:13:36,919 --> 00:13:39,320
Then you can't leave me out of the money.

226
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,240
This thing has just started.

227
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:43,159
Just get what I told you done first.

228
00:13:43,159 --> 00:13:46,480
If it works out, you'll get your cut.

229
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:47,200
Alright?

230
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:47,799
Okay.

231
00:13:48,159 --> 00:13:49,320
I'll get on it right away.

232
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,159
Good.

233
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,519
Construction company

234
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:05,320
Philanthropist

235
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,559
Virtual trading platform

236
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,000
Bro Snake.

237
00:14:21,399 --> 00:14:23,399
I made you a pot of tea. Have a taste.

238
00:14:25,919 --> 00:14:26,720
Bro Snake.

239
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,799
Qin Changxian

240
00:14:46,799 --> 00:14:48,399
Male, 60 years old

241
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:55,559
Li Wen

242
00:14:55,559 --> 00:14:56,320
Brother Liu

243
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,200
What are you doing here?
